    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense PvE Battles &amp; Tournaments</strong><br>Jump into high-speed battles, take down legendary opponents, and win exclusive rewards. Compete in tournaments\u2014or host your own right in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Epic Spin Blades</strong><br>Mix and match rare parts to forge powerful, custom Spin Blades built for your strategy. No two builds are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/7e219beb38db47b163dd6bbccd1f824b.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/7e219beb38db47b163dd6bbccd1f824b.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/7e219beb38db47b163dd6bbccd1f824b.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Like a Legend</strong><br>Hunt down rare, epic, and legendary parts to build a standout collection. Show it off and earn your spot as a top collector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/e9e8b552fce39cb73eb724f739c00299.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/e9e8b552fce39cb73eb724f739c00299.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/e9e8b552fce39cb73eb724f739c00299.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the Ultimate Spin Blade Shop</strong><br>Start small, grow big. Stock up, upgrade your store, and automate your business to dominate the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/f7f62be4c5fca2379e9f17f37d2d9b5c.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/f7f62be4c5fca2379e9f17f37d2d9b5c.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/f7f62be4c5fca2379e9f17f37d2d9b5c.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Custom Builds</strong><br>Design and sell your own powerful Spin Blades. Set the price, attract buyers, and build your brand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/37ef96ef6e50608afdb08fa69872413d.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense PvE Battles &amp; Tournaments</strong><br>Jump into high-speed battles, take down legendary opponents, and win exclusive rewards. Compete in tournaments\u2014or host your own right in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/4f69d5b7903402b988bab6681a0d2cbf.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Epic Spin Blades</strong><br>Mix and match rare parts to forge powerful, custom Spin Blades built for your strategy. No two builds are the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/7e219beb38db47b163dd6bbccd1f824b.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/7e219beb38db47b163dd6bbccd1f824b.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/7e219beb38db47b163dd6bbccd1f824b.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Like a Legend</strong><br>Hunt down rare, epic, and legendary parts to build a standout collection. Show it off and earn your spot as a top collector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/e9e8b552fce39cb73eb724f739c00299.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/e9e8b552fce39cb73eb724f739c00299.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/e9e8b552fce39cb73eb724f739c00299.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run the Ultimate Spin Blade Shop</strong><br>Start small, grow big. Stock up, upgrade your store, and automate your business to dominate the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/f7f62be4c5fca2379e9f17f37d2d9b5c.poster.avif?t=1755441444\" width=754 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/f7f62be4c5fca2379e9f17f37d2d9b5c.webm?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3695600/extras/f7f62be4c5fca2379e9f17f37d2d9b5c.mp4?t=1755441444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Custom Builds</strong><br>Design and sell your own powerful Spin Blades. Set the price, attract buyers, and build your brand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
